{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-382",
  "title": "Project Brief",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Project Brief"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1) Positioning & Promise"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**One‑liner:** A private, ad‑free marketplace and community where Black & Brown creators and operators sell services, digital goods, and physical products—backed by transparent profit‑sharing and safety‑first onboarding."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Differentiators:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Invite‑only, buy‑to‑sell model → real participants, less spam."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Profit‑sharing + community governance → aligned incentives."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Services + digital + physical in one stack → fewer context switches."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Ad‑free, privacy‑forward → trust by default."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2) Users & Core Jobs-To-Be-Done (JTBD)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Vendors**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "List offerings quickly (services, digital files, shippables) with simple pricing, variants, and fulfillment rules."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Get paid reliably (instant payouts when possible) and build reputation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Collaborate/find gigs through feeds, forums, and job boards."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Buyers**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Discover quality vendors through curated, community‑led signals."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Book services (escrow + milestones), purchase digital goods (instant delivery), or buy physical items (live rates + tracking)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Community Members**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Share knowledge, events, opportunities, and feedback without ads or algorithmic noise."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3) Guardrails & Principles"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Security:** invite‑only + KYC‑lite for sellers; device/session hardening; zero‑trust defaults."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-25",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Transparency:** visible fee splits, platform policies, and dispute outcomes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Autonomy:** sellers keep IP; clear licensing options for digital goods."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Equity:** profit‑sharing model and community funds earmarked for grants."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4) MVP Scope (90 Days)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Must‑have**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Auth (PocketBase) with invitation codes & roles (buyer, vendor, moderator, admin)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Vendor onboarding: identity check, buy‑to‑sell verification (first purchase or membership), payout connection (Stripe Connect Express)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Listings: services, digital files, physical goods (single‑SKU + simple variants)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Cart/checkout: Stripe (Card, Apple/Google Pay); live shipping estimates via Shippo; tax basic."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Order flows: services (escrow + milestones), digital (download/license), physical (label/fulfillment + tracking)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Community: lightweight feed (markdown posts), DMs, and event posting."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Moderation: report content, takedown queue, vendor strike system."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Nice‑to‑have**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Job board module (post, apply, shortlist)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Forums with category subscriptions and reputation badges."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Basic analytics for vendors (views, conversion, fulfillment SLA)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5) Revenue & Economics"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Platform fee:** 7–12% take on successful transactions, tiered by membership."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Memberships:** optional monthly to unlock lower fees, advanced storefront tools, and boosted discovery."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Profit‑sharing:** fixed % of platform net goes to the Community Fund; quarterly transparent reports."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Payouts:** Stripe Connect; instant payout option (Stripe Instant Payouts) where available."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6) Policies & Compliance (MVP Level)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-51",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**KYC‑lite for sellers:** name, verified email/phone, connected payout; trigger enhanced checks on volume or flags."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-52",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Terms & Licenses:** standard licenses for digital goods; service SOW templates; refund & dispute policy."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-53",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Taxes:** collect destination sales tax where feasible; provide 1099‑K via Stripe; vendor dashboard reminders."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-54",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Content:** prohibited items & hate content policy; zero‑tolerance list; transparent appeals."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "7) Feature Design Notes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Services (Escrow + Milestones)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-58",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Quote types: fixed, hourly (with cap), milestone payments."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-59",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "In‑thread contracting: scope, deliverables, timeline, revision policy; e‑sign via Stripe or simple click‑wrap."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-60",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dispute flow: hold funds, mediator review, evidence upload, binding outcome."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Digital Goods**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-63",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Upload to PocketBase storage; virus scan; checksum; versioning."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-64",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "License picker (Personal, Commercial, Custom); download count and revocation if refund."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-65",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Stamping: order ID embedded in file metadata for light deterrence."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Physical Goods**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-68",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Shippo live rates at checkout; label purchase from vendor dashboard."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-69",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Required fields: weight, dims, HS code (optional at MVP), country of origin."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-70",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Returns: RMA request flow, return label optionally vendor‑paid."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Community**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-73",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Feeds with tags and moderation actions; DM with request/accept model."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-74",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Events: date/time, RSVP, virtual link, geotag city‑level (no precise addresses by default)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "8) Trust & Safety System"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-77",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Invite graph:** inviter reputation tracked; bad‑actor propagation detection."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-78",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Vendor verification levels:** L1 (light), L2 (docs), L3 (volume‑based upgrade)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-79",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Strike rules:** content, fulfillment, chargeback, communication; thresholds for suspensions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-80",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Marketplace health metrics:** order defect rate (ODR), on‑time rate, dispute rate, message response time."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "9) Architecture & Tech"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Frontend**: Nuxt 4 + Tailwind + shadcn/ui‑thing; SSR + islands; file uploads w/ resumable."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Backend**: PocketBase (auth, storage, collections), edge adapters (Hono/Vercel) for webhooks; background workers (Cloud Run) for: shipping rating, label purchase, notification fan‑out, escrow state machine."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Integrations**: Stripe (Payments + Connect + Webhooks), Shippo (rates, labels, tracking), Email (Postmark), SMS (Twilio), Image proxy/optimization (Vercel)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-86",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Data model (high‑level)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-92",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-87",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "users, orgs\\vendors, invites, memberships"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-88",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "listings (type: service | digital | physical), variants, media"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-89",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "carts, orders, order_items, fulfillments, milestones, disputes"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-90",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "payouts, fees, community_fund_ledger"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-91",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "posts, comments, messages, events, reports"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-93",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "10) Security Model"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-99",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-94",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Role‑based access control (RBAC) at collection level in PocketBase."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-95",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Session: httpOnly cookies, short‑lived tokens, device fingerprinting."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-96",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Storage: signed URLs for downloads; per‑file ACLs; download watermarking."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-97",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webhooks: signed (Stripe/Shippo) + replay protection; HMAC on internal callbacks."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-98",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Audit log: moderation, payouts, policy changes."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-100",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "11) Operational Runbook (MVP)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-105",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-101",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "On‑call rotation (even if solo): pager to Slack; error severity rubric."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-102",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Incident response: comms templates, status page playbook."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-103",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Backup/restore: nightly PocketBase snapshot; storage versioning."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-104",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "SLA targets: Checkout p95 < 400ms; Webhooks ≤ 5s; File download TTFB < 300ms."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-106",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "12) Analytics & KPIs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-110",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-107",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "GMV, take‑rate, repeat purchase rate, vendor activation rate, time‑to‑first‑listing, time‑to‑first‑sale."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-108",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Marketplace health: ODR < 2%, dispute rate < 1%, on‑time fulfillment > 95%."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-109",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
